 pproved: QWER Hacks\n\nHi Gustavo\,\n\nHow about 3:30pm tomorrow? In person
  or zoom?\n\nThanks\,\nMargaret\n\nOn Tue\, Nov 1\, 2022 at 2:27 PM Calleja
 s\, Gustavo <gcallejas@support.ucla.edu<mailto:gcallejas@support.ucla.edu>>
  wrote:\nHi Margaret\,\n\nThank you for reaching out. Fundraising can be a 
