 Monday\, October 31\, 2022 3:23:54 PM\nTo: Callejas\, Gustavo <gcallejas@su
 pport.ucla.edu>\nSubject: Re: Spark Application Approved: QWER Hacks\n\nHi 
 Gustavo\,\n\nHope you are well. I wanted to check in on something. Ideally 
 with the Spark campaign\, QWER Hacks wants to leverage the UCLA engineering
  and corporate network.\n\nWhen we initially spoke\, I was under the impres
 sion that UCLA engineering/non-engineering alumni/donors would be the main 
