 th Stephanie and Andrie today\, they said that the majority of monetary con
 tributions will come from friends/family. Can you please clarify this for m
 e?\n\nThank you!\nMargaret\n\nOn Mon\, Oct 31\, 2022 at 11:09 AM Callejas\,
  Gustavo <gcallejas@support.ucla.edu> wrote:\nHi Margaret\,\n\nI'm out of t
 he office today so I will not be able to attend. Stephanie and Andrie are f
