DESCRIPTION:<br><u><b>We will be going over:</b></u><br><br>1)&nbsp\;<b>The
  workshops schedule.</b>&nbsp\;I sent out a link to the spreadsheet to sign
  up for a workshop time in a previous email. We will be reviewing the sprea
 dsheet\, and let us know at the meeting if you have any questions!<br><br>2
 )&nbsp\;<b>Our publicity calendar.</b>&nbsp\;Thank you to everyone who has 
 already shared information about QWER Hacks with their circles (s/o to&nbsp
 \;@Hannah for sending a QWER Hacks email to the QSTEM listserv\, @Sohini fo
 r adding an announcement to the LGBT CRC's Bruin Pride Newsletter\, and&nbs
 p\;<a href="mailto:Baolinh.nguyen@ucla.edu">@Baolinh.nguyen@ucla.edu</a>&nb
 sp\;<wbr>for sharing the event on LinkedIn)! We will do another massive adv
 ertising push on social media Sunday night during the meeting\,&nbsp\;<b><u
 >so please please please bring your laptops with you!</u></b><br><br>3)&nbs
 p\;<b>Other general updates</b>\, like about our CPC fund hearing\, how we'
 re officially partnering with the Trevor Project :o\, and how Palo Alto Net
 works is donating 1500 bucks!
