 ee to email me if you have any further questions.\n\n\n\nYour event details
  appointment should be completed with no later than 3 weeks before your eve
 nt\, no later than DATE. Failure to complete details by this 3-week deadlin
 e may result in the cancellation of your reservation.\n\nThe final day to m
 ake any changes to your event is 2 weeks before your event\, DATE. Any chan
 ges made after this date will result in additional fees.\n\nCatering:\nEven
 ts held in the ASUCLA Student Union must use our exclusive caterer\, ASUCLA
  Catering. As a student organizations you are eligible for special pricing 
