 .edu/event-services/student-groups/student-union-event-fund/ for guidelines
 \, deadlines\, and allocations.\nYour SOLE advisor can also advise you on t
 he other funding sources available.\n\nAdvertising:\nEvents held in the ASU
 CLA Student Union can be advertised with a digital flyer for one week\, fre
 e of charge. Other events and group initiatives can also be advertised on o
 ur screens\, for a nominal fee. For specs\, rates\, and more\, check out ht
