DESCRIPTION:[QWER Hacks] Assignment #1 Deadline\n\nPlease create the conten
 t for your slides for all your workshops. To clarify\, this does NOT includ
 e graphics\, formatting\, fonts\, colors\, etc. All you need is bullet poin
 ts on your slides that give an overview of the topics you will be covering 
 in each set of slides you need to make. The bullet points can be VERY rough
 .\n\nPlease share your slides with qwerhacks@gmail.com!\n\nAt 6 PM on Decem
 ber 1\, 2019\, QWER Hacks organizers will review your content and get back 
 to you with any questions/concerns/feedback we have. In the meanwhile\, ple
 ase ask us any questions you have.
LAST-MODIFIED:20221209T162059Z
