  us to understand the planning you have completed so far for your event\, a
 s well as answer any questions you have about becoming or being an MLH Memb
 er Event.\n\n\nFeel free to look over our MLH Hackathon Organizer Guide (ht
 tps://calendly.com/url?q=https%3A%2F%2Fguide.mlh.io%2F)  or include your qu
 estions while signing up for this meeting.\n\nLocation: This is a Google Me
 et web conference.\nYou can join this meeting from your computer\, tablet\,
  or smartphone.\nhttps://calendly.com/events/dfc49e51-774a-496a-9e9d-a6444d
 7d6258/google_meet\n\nWhat is the name of your hackathon?: QWER Hacks\n\nWh
 at is the start date of your event?: January 24th\, 2025\n\nPlease share an
 y questions you have about your application or MLH benefits. If none\, plea
 se say none!: None\n\nPowered by Calendly.com\n\n\n-::~:~::~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:
