DESCRIPTION:<b><u>Structure of the meeting:</u></b><br>&nbsp\;1) 15-20 min:
  We will give all co-programming orgs the opportunity to ask us questions a
 bout logistics of the event\, what we have accomplished thus far\, and what
  we have left to do. In addition\, we want to know what you would like to s
 ee happen at QWER Hacks\, i.e. what is your vision for the event?<br>2) 20-
 30 min: We will collaboratively figure out in what ways each org will contr
 ibute to the event\, whether that be through technical workshops\, diversit
 y and inclusion workshops\, publicity\, contacting sponsors\, etc.<br>3) 10
 -20 min: For organizations that are putting on workshops\, we will briefly 
 discuss what content to cover\, and have you guys start working on content.
LAST-MODIFIED:20221209T162052Z
LOCATION:Sproul Living Room
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:QWER Hacks Co-programming Meeting #1
TRANSP:OPAQUE
